# Sportsphere — Store credentials (NEVER commit these)
#
# Real Apple / Google / Expo credentials live here. They are .gitignored.
# Each developer must populate this folder locally with their own copies.
# Reference paths in mobile/eas.json point to these filenames.

# Apple App Store Connect API key (used by `eas submit --platform ios`)
AuthKey_*.p8

# Google Play service account JSON (used by `eas submit --platform android`)
google-service-account-key.json

# Provisioning profiles / certificates (rarely needed — EAS manages them)
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
*.p12

# Local copies of any store listing drafts (the canonical version lives in listings/)
*.draft.json
